; A safety device (CiA DSP 304): node 5, SRDO 1 produces 2000h (16 bit) and 2001h (8 bit) on the
; pre-defined ids, SRDO 2 is declared but has direction 0, and 13FEh/13FFh. 13FFh:01 is patched
; by the tests with the checksum the implementation computes.

